# Portfolio repository: keep only C++ source and the minimum Unreal project files.
# Everything at the project root is ignored unless explicitly allowed below.
/*

# Repository metadata and documentation
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md

# Minimum files needed to identify and configure the Unreal project
!/PestControl.uproject
!/Config/

# C++ source (including *.Build.cs and target files)
!/Source/
